<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        {% set description_block %}{% block page_description %}Créez un CV à votre image et partagez votre parcours professionnel avec PerformCV.{% endblock %}{% endset %}
        {% set page_description = public_seo.plainText(description_block) %}
        <meta name="description" content="{{ page_description }}">
        <title>{% block title %}PerformCV{% endblock %}</title>
        {% set canonical = public_canonical is defined ? public_canonical : public_seo.canonical(app.request.attributes.get('_route')) %}
        {% if canonical %}<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical }}">{% endif %}
        {% include 'shared/_social_meta.html.twig' with {social_page_title: public_seo.plainText(block('title'))} %}
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/app.css') }}">
        <script src="{{ asset('ui.js') }}" defer></script>
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
        {% block stylesheets %}{% endblock %}
        {% if cookie_consent.analyticsAllowed(app.request) %}
            <script src="{{ asset('analytics.js') }}" defer></script>
        {% endif %}
    </head>
    <body>
        <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Aller au contenu</a>
        <header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="{{ path('app_home') }}" aria-label="PerformCV, accueil"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H5v20h14V7l-5-5Zm0 0v5h5M8 12h8m-8 4h6"/></svg></span>perform<span>cv</span><span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><nav aria-label="Navigation principale"><a href="{{ path('app_cv_directory') }}">Annuaire des CV</a>{% if app.request.cookies.count and app.user %}<a href="{{ path('app_dashboard') }}" {{ app.request.attributes.get('_route') == 'app_dashboard' ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' }}>Mon espace</a><a href="{{ path('app_account') }}">Mon compte</a>{% include 'guides/_menu.html.twig' %}<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_logout') }}"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('logout') }}"><button class="link" type="submit">Déconnexion ↗</button></form>{% else %}{% include 'guides/_menu.html.twig' %}<a href="{{ path('app_login') }}">Se connecter</a><a class="button small" href="{{ path('app_register') }}">Commencer ↗</a>{% endif %}</nav></header>
        {% if cookie_consent.preferences(app.request) is null and app.request.attributes.get('_route') != 'app_cookies' %}
            <aside class="cookie-popup" role="region" aria-labelledby="cookie-popup-title" data-cookie-popup data-preferences-url="{{ path('app_cookies') }}">
                <h2 id="cookie-popup-title">Aidez-nous à améliorer PerformCV</h2>
                <p>Avec votre accord, Google Analytics nous aide à comprendre quelles pages sont utiles et à améliorer le site. Vous pouvez changer d’avis à tout moment.</p>
                <div class="cookie-popup-actions">
                    <button class="button secondary" type="button" data-cookie-choice="accept">Accepter les statistiques</button>
                    <button class="button secondary" type="button" data-cookie-choice="reject">Refuser</button>
                </div>
                <p><a href="{{ path('app_cookies') }}">Gérer mon choix et en savoir plus</a></p>
                <p data-cookie-status role="status" hidden></p>
                <noscript><p>Pour enregistrer votre choix, ouvrez la page <a href="{{ path('app_cookies') }}">Cookies et traceurs</a>.</p></noscript>
            </aside>
        {% endif %}
        <main id="main" class="site-main">{% for type, messages in (app.request.cookies.count and app.request.hasPreviousSession ? app.flashes : []) %}{% for message in messages %}<div class="notice {{ type }}" role="status">{{ message }}</div>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}{% block body %}{% endblock %}</main>
        <footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand" href="{{ path('app_home') }}">perform<span>cv</span>.</a><p>Votre parcours. Vos perspectives.</p><a href="{{ path('app_legal') }}">Mentions légales</a><a href="{{ path('app_privacy') }}">Confidentialité</a><a href="{{ path('app_terms') }}">Conditions d’utilisation</a><a href="{{ path('app_cookies') }}">Cookies et traceurs</a></footer>
    </body>
</html>
